# corpus/mac/bug_B2_imessage_enter_01 — B2 Messages (com.apple.ichat): Enter ×3 không lặp từ (P2-5 §2)
:config method=telex diacritic_style=new
:app com.apple.ichat field=body

:type "chaof"
:expect "chào"
:key Space
:type "banj"
:expect "chào bạn"
:key Enter
:expect "chào bạn\n"
:key Enter
:expect "chào bạn\n\n"
:key Enter
:expect "chào bạn\n\n\n"
